          "cells": [
            {
              "id": "workflow-0-column-0",
              "row": 0,
              "column": 0,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "01  Customer intake",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#FFFFFF",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#070154"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-0-column-1",
              "row": 0,
              "column": 1,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Teams re-enter customer and case details across channels. Incomplete requests create clarification loops and inconsistent handoffs. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case. Each owner must review and resolve evidence gaps before accepting the case.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#E8EEF8"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-0-column-2",
              "row": 0,
              "column": 2,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Capture required information once, validate it at entry and route exceptions to a named owner. Retain human review where judgment or policy requires it.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#CFDAFF"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-0-column-3",
              "row": 0,
              "column": 3,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Completion time; rework rate; first-pass completeness; avoidable handoffs",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#FCE5F8"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-1-column-0",
              "row": 1,
              "column": 0,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "02  Case preparation",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#FFFFFF",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#070154"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-1-column-1",
              "row": 1,
              "column": 1,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Specialists gather documents and reference data from multiple systems. The evidence trail depends on local files and individual knowledge. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path. Every exception requires an accountable approver and a documented recovery path.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#E8EEF8"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-1-column-2",
              "row": 1,
              "column": 2,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Assemble a traceable case record through managed interfaces. Show source provenance, missing evidence and reconciliation status before the case advances.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#CFDAFF"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-1-column-3",
              "row": 1,
              "column": 3,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Preparation time; missing evidence; duplicate records; reconciliation exceptions",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#FCE5F8"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-2-column-0",
              "row": 2,
              "column": 0,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "03  Decision & action",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#FFFFFF",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#070154"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-2-column-1",
              "row": 2,
              "column": 1,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Work queues hide dependency and approval status. Escalations rely on messages, and the rationale for decisions can be difficult to recover.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#E8EEF8"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-2-column-2",
              "row": 2,
              "column": 2,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Make state, ownership and approval rules explicit. Route exceptions by reason, capture decision rationale and retain an auditable record of human approvals.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#CFDAFF"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-2-column-3",
              "row": 2,
              "column": 3,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Queue age; approval time; exception volume; reopened cases; audit completeness",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#FCE5F8"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-3-column-0",
              "row": 3,
              "column": 0,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "04  Fulfilment & service",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#FFFFFF",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#070154"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-3-column-1",
              "row": 3,
              "column": 1,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Downstream changes require coordinated manual updates. Failures emerge through user reports, and teams reconcile outcomes after the event.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#E8EEF8"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-3-column-2",
              "row": 3,
              "column": 2,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Publish validated events and managed APIs. Monitor end-to-end completion, expose failed handoffs and provide controlled retry, rollback and recovery procedures.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#CFDAFF"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-3-column-3",
              "row": 3,
              "column": 3,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Failed handoffs; recovery time; reconciliation lag; repeat contacts",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#FCE5F8"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-4-column-0",
              "row": 4,
              "column": 0,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "05  Improvement & control",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": true,
                  "foreground": "#FFFFFF",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#070154"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-4-column-1",
              "row": 4,
              "column": 1,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Reporting is assembled retrospectively. Product, service and business owners use different measures to prioritize fixes and investment.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#E8EEF8"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-4-column-2",
              "row": 4,
              "column": 2,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Create a shared measurement cadence with agreed definitions and owners. Use observed outcomes to prioritize the backlog, assess controls and select the next wave.",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#CFDAFF"
            },
            {
              "id": "workflow-4-column-3",
              "row": 4,
              "column": 3,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "content",
                  "text": "Change lead time; service incidents; adoption; support demand; cost to serve",
                  "font_face": "Arial",
                  "font_size_pt": 10.5,
                  "bold": false,
                  "foreground": "#070154",
                  "min_height_pt": 0,
                  "gap_before_pt": 0,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              ],
              "padding": {
                "top": 5.5,
                "right": 8,
                "bottom": 5.5,
                "left": 8
              },
              "background": "#FCE5F8"
            }
